{"id": "m54", "type": "版本", "question": "v2 生效后，A 团队之前按 v1 提交、还在验收期内的在途事项会被 v2 重新计算吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "81f4866b-b693-4178-9f45-578c87f99267", "elapsed_ms": 8258, "answer": "不会；v2 仅适用于 2026-10-01 起提交的阶段交付，不自动追溯变更旧提交的约定，之前按 v1 提交的在途事项仍按提交日期适用 v1。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C2", "C3"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-D2-01", "in_top5": true}, {"anchor": "A-F2-06", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-D2-01", "in_top20": true}, {"anchor": "A-F2-06", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "在途期限按 v2 重算或缩短", "leaked": false}]}
